# ArticleCompanyCTA

## Purpose
Centered call-to-action section with a subtle background, heading, body, button link, and optional note.

## Static HTML Configuration
Create `article-company-cta.html`. No imports, framework, or JavaScript are required. Replace text and attributes directly; the documented props map to HTML as follows.

### Required
| Prop | Type | HTML mapping / description |
|---|---|---|
| `title` | `string` | `<h2>` text; CTA heading |
| `body` | `string` | Body `<p>` text; CTA description |
| `buttonText` | `string` | `<a>` text; primary button label |
| `buttonHref` | `string` | `<a href>`; destination URL |

### Optional
| Prop | Type | Default | HTML mapping / description |
|---|---|---|---|
| `note` | `string` | — | Small paragraph below the link; omit when unused |
| `id` | `string` | — | Section `id` for anchor linking |
| `className` | `string` | — | Additional section `class` values |
| `buttonVariant` | `'primary' \| 'secondary'` | `'primary'` | Base button class is primary; add `company-cta__button--secondary` for secondary |

## Semantic Hints
`cta`, `company-cta`, `promo`, `action-block`, `conversion`, `call-to-action`, `promotion`, `signup`

## When to Use
Use for simple newsletter, demo, or contact CTAs. Limit to **one per article**.

## Structure and Styling
A semantic `<section>` contains a centered, width-constrained `<div>`, followed by `<h2>`, body `<p>`, button-styled `<a>`, and optional note `<p>`. Use generous spacing, rounded corners, a subtle background, bold heading, muted body and note text, and a prominent brand-colored link.

## Accessibility
Associate the section with its heading using `aria-labelledby` and a unique heading ID. Preserve link semantics for navigation. Maintain sufficient text contrast and a visible keyboard focus state.

## Complete Example
```html
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>Newsletter</title>
  <style>
    body { margin: 0; padding: 1rem; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; }
    .company-cta {
      padding: 3rem 1.5rem;
      border-radius: 1rem;
      background: #f9fafb;
      color: #111827;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .company-cta__content { max-width: 40rem; margin-inline: auto; }
    .company-cta h2 { margin: 0; font-size: 2rem; font-weight: 700; }
    .company-cta p { margin: 1rem 0; color: #4b5563; line-height: 1.6; }
    .company-cta__button {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: .875rem 1.5rem;
      border-radius: .5rem;
      background: #1d4ed8;
      color: #fff;
      font-weight: 700;
      text-decoration: none;
    }
    .company-cta__button:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
    .company-cta__button--secondary { background: #374151; }
    .company-cta__button:focus-visible {
      outline: 3px solid #111827;
      outline-offset: 4px;
    }
    .company-cta__note { font-size: .875rem; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <section class="company-cta" id="newsletter-cta"
    aria-labelledby="newsletter-cta-title">
    <div class="company-cta__content">
      <h2 id="newsletter-cta-title">Stay Updated on AI Trends</h2>
      <p>Get weekly insights on AI implementation, best practices, and industry news delivered to your inbox.</p>
      <a class="company-cta__button" href="/newsletter">Subscribe to Newsletter</a>
      <p class="company-cta__note">No spam, unsubscribe anytime.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</body>
</html>
```

